IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ALTER-STATEMENT.
*> ALTER as cobc 3.2 generates it: label_N per altered paragraph,
*> GO TO without target, and labels of independent segments (> 49)
*> zapped on fall-through and on PERFORM from another segment.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 TRACE-LINE PIC X(40) VALUE SPACES.
01 POS        PIC 99 VALUE 1.
01 ROUND      PIC 9 VALUE 0.
01 PHASE      PIC X VALUE "P".
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PART SECTION.
START-HERE.
    PERFORM SWITCH-PARA THRU SWITCH-EXIT.
    ALTER SWITCH-PARA TO PROCEED TO SECOND-WAY.
    PERFORM SWITCH-PARA THRU SWITCH-EXIT.
    ALTER SWITCH-PARA TO THIRD-WAY, 10 TO 20.
    PERFORM SWITCH-PARA THRU SWITCH-EXIT.
    PERFORM 10 THRU 30.
    DISPLAY TRACE-LINE.
    MOVE SPACES TO TRACE-LINE.
    MOVE 1 TO POS.
*> Independent segment: first PERFORM sees the label reset.
    ALTER IND-SWITCH TO PROCEED TO IND-B.
    PERFORM INDEPENDENT-PART.
    ALTER IND-SWITCH TO PROCEED TO IND-B.
    PERFORM IND-SWITCH THRU IND-EXIT.
    PERFORM IND-SWITCH THRU IND-EXIT.
    DISPLAY TRACE-LINE.
    MOVE SPACES TO TRACE-LINE.
    MOVE 1 TO POS.
    ALTER EMPTY-GO TO PROCEED TO EMPTY-TARGET.
    PERFORM EMPTY-GO THRU EMPTY-EXIT.
    DISPLAY TRACE-LINE.
    GO TO FALL-INTO.
SWITCH-PARA.
    GO TO FIRST-WAY.
FIRST-WAY.
    MOVE "1" TO TRACE-LINE (POS:1). ADD 1 TO POS.
    GO TO SWITCH-EXIT.
SECOND-WAY.
    MOVE "2" TO TRACE-LINE (POS:1). ADD 1 TO POS.
    GO TO SWITCH-EXIT.
THIRD-WAY.
    MOVE "3" TO TRACE-LINE (POS:1). ADD 1 TO POS.
SWITCH-EXIT.
    EXIT.
10.
    GO TO 30.
20.
    MOVE "N" TO TRACE-LINE (POS:1). ADD 1 TO POS.
30.
    MOVE "E" TO TRACE-LINE (POS:1). ADD 1 TO POS.
EMPTY-GO.
    GO TO.
EMPTY-FALL.
    MOVE "F" TO TRACE-LINE (POS:1). ADD 1 TO POS.
EMPTY-TARGET.
    MOVE "T" TO TRACE-LINE (POS:1). ADD 1 TO POS.
EMPTY-EXIT.
    EXIT.
BACK-AGAIN.
*> A GO TO from another segment resets the independent label.
    ALTER IND-SWITCH TO PROCEED TO IND-B.
    GO TO IND-SWITCH.
FALL-INTO.
    MOVE "F" TO PHASE.
    MOVE SPACES TO TRACE-LINE.
    MOVE 1 TO POS.
    ALTER IND-SWITCH TO PROCEED TO IND-B.
INDEPENDENT-PART SECTION 60.
IND-SWITCH.
    GO TO IND-A.
IND-A.
    MOVE "A" TO TRACE-LINE (POS:1). ADD 1 TO POS.
    GO TO IND-EXIT.
IND-B.
    MOVE "B" TO TRACE-LINE (POS:1). ADD 1 TO POS.
IND-EXIT.
    EXIT.
IND-DONE.
    IF PHASE = "P"
        GO TO IND-END.
    IF ROUND = 0
        MOVE 1 TO ROUND
        DISPLAY TRACE-LINE
        MOVE SPACES TO TRACE-LINE
        MOVE 1 TO POS
        ALTER IND-SWITCH TO PROCEED TO IND-B
        GO TO IND-SWITCH.
    IF ROUND = 1
        MOVE 2 TO ROUND
        DISPLAY TRACE-LINE
        MOVE SPACES TO TRACE-LINE
        MOVE 1 TO POS
        GO TO BACK-AGAIN.
    DISPLAY TRACE-LINE.
    STOP RUN.
IND-END.
    EXIT.
